    "turn_text": "That's right And once again, we don't know the circumstances here what we do know is that these police officers Had a tip Okay? That some kids were gathering at a fairly busy intersection at, you know, 630 in the evening, which is hardly late. And that some of them might have guns. So the cops obviously had to check that out. This is what, if you talk to police officers, they get this stuff all the time. You know, a tip, check out this or check out that. There's a cat in the tree. Could you go check that out? That kind of thing. And they spend a lot of their time checking out tips. As they got out of the car, apparently gunfire opened up. And why these kids shot at these police officers, we don't know. And once again, this cries out from a major investigation, at least put the facts on the table as we know them, but I think I think the police down in Newark don't don't know why all this happened.",
