    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/7/97119.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 16,
    "turn_text": "Larry, that's a very good point, but I think it's even deeper than that. I think these kids, they see guns almost as toys, and they just fire them off at willy-nilly, and I think that's what happened here. Their immediate reaction was to take a shot at somebody. And in this case, the shot was a fatal shot. And I don't think that they have any regard whatsoever for the consequences of pulling the trigger.",
