    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/7/97119.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 17,
    "turn_text": "Hey, let's talk about the race for governor for a second. Only because I was stunned to see a couple of recent polls with Sean Spiller in second place. Now, I've interviewed him several times. He's an impressive guy back when he was head of the teachers union. But to be in second place is kind of stunning to me. I understand nobody's really got a clear shot at victory at this point. There's a lot of names in this race, and for Sean Spillerhoe, I think most people don't know to be in second place is a little bit shocking.",
